[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 1. **Define Variables:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Let \( x \) be the number of coins in each of the seven original bags. So, the total number of coins initially is \( 7x \).
