[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 1. **Define Variables:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Let \( n \) be the number of coins in each of the seven bags initially. Therefore, the total number of coins initially is \( 7n \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 2. **After Finding the Bag of 53 Coins:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    After finding a bag with 53 coins, the new total number of coins becomes \( 7n + 53 \).
