[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    n = 8m + 3
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    To minimize \( n \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    8m + 3 > 200 \implies 8m > 197 \implies m > \frac{197}{8} \implies m > 24.625
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    So, \( m \geq 25 \). Let's try \( m = 25 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    n = 8(25) + 3 = 200 + 3 = 203
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Check if \( 7n + 53 \) is divisible by 8:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7 \times 203 + 53 = 1421 + 53 = 1474
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    And check \( 1474 \mod 8 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    1474 \div 8 = 184.25 \implies 1474 \mod 8 = 2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Since \( 1474 \mod 8 = 2 \), it does not satisfy the requirement. We try the next smallest integer for \( m \), which is \( m = 26 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    n = 8(26) + 3 = 208 + 3 = 211
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Check:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7 \times 211 + 53 = 1477 + 53 = 1530
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    And \( 1530 \mod 8 = 2 \), still not correct. So the next smallest integer that works is \( m = 27 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    n = 8(27) + 3 = 216 + 3 = 219
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Check:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7 \times 219 + 53 = 1533 + 53 = 1586
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    And \( 1586 \mod 8 = 2 \), not correct. The next is \( m = 28 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    n = 8(28) + 3 = 224 + 3 = 227
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Check:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7 \times 227 + 53 = 1589 + 53 = 1642
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    And \( 1642 \mod 8 = 2 \). Let's try the final integer until it fits:
