[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7 \times 203 + 53 = 1421 + 53 = 1474
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    And \( 1474 \mod 8 = 2 \). Correct next smallest is \( m = 25 \), ensuring integer solutions match smallest value of \( n \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m Finally, we get the smallest possible number of coins that fits all conditions:
