[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m n = 203
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m and the total number of coins before redistributing:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 7n + 53 = 7(203) + 53 = 1421 + 53 = 1474
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m Thus, the smallest number of coins he had before finding the bag of 53 coins is:
