[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7N + 53 = 7 \cdot 9 + 53 = 63 + 53 = 116
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    116 is still less than 200, so we try the next possible \( N \). For \( k = 2 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    N = 8 \cdot 2 + 1 = 17
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
