[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7N = 7 \cdot 17 = 119
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Checking if this is greater than 200:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7N + 53 = 7 \cdot 17 + 53 = 119 + 53 = 172
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    We keep testing values of \( k \) until the sum of coins exceeds 200:
