[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Since $x$ must be an integer, we need to find the smallest multiple of 7 plus 7 that satisfies the equation. We start by checking smaller values of $k$:
