[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      This gives us $x = 15$ and $y = 26$, and the total number of coins is $7x + 53 = 7 \cdot 15 + 53 = 105 + 53 = 158$, which is less than $208$. So we continue to the next integer value for $k$.
