[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m However, since we need more than 200 coins, and \( k = 2 \) gives \( x = 21 \):
