[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 3. **Calculate the number of ways to form a subcommittee with at least one member from each party by subtracting the number of all-republican or all-democratic subcommittees from the total number of subcommittees:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
