[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 2. Here, we are given that the arithmetic mean of the numbers \(7\), \(2\), \(x\), and \(10\) is \(9\). The formula for the arithmetic mean is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
