[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Now, substitute this back into the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    9 = \frac{19 + x}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 4. **Solve for \( x \):**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
