[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m ### **Step 1: Define Variables**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m - Let \( n \) be the original number of coins in each of the seven bags.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m   
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m - So, the total number of coins initially is \( 7n \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m ### **Step 2: Add the New Bag of 53 Coins**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
