[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m   
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m   \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m   7n + 53
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m   \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m ### **Step 3: Redistribute the Coins Equally**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m - We now want to redistribute all the coins so that there are eight bags, each with the same number of coins. Let \( x \) be the number of coins in each of these eight bags.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
