[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m ### **Step 5: Substitute Back into the Initial Equation**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m From the equation \( 7n + 53 = 8x \), substitute \( x = 7k + 4 \):
