[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    We are given the arithmetic mean of the numbers 7, 2, \(x\), and 10 is 9. The arithmetic mean is calculated by summing all the numbers and then dividing by the count of the numbers.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 2. **Set Up the Equation:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    The formula for the arithmetic mean is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
