[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    y = 7(29) + 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    y = 203 + 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    y = 207
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 8. **Verify the Solution**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Total number of coins initially:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
