[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m ### Step 1: Recall the Formula for Arithmetic Mean
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m The arithmetic mean (average) of a set of numbers is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
