[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    b. **Eliminate the Denominator**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    To get rid of the denominator, multiply both sides of the equation by 4:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    9 \times 4 = 19 + x
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    36 = 19 + x
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    c. **Isolate \( x \)**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
