[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m Mathematically, the arithmetic mean \( \mu \) of \( n \) numbers \( a_1, a_2, \dots, a_n \) is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \[
