[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 3. **Analyze the Constraints:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - From the redistribution, \( 7n + 53 \) must be divisible by 8. Therefore, \( 7n + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8} \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Simplify the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      7n + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      7n \equiv -53 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Since \( 7 \equiv -1 \pmod{8} \), we can rewrite the equation as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      -n \equiv -53 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      n \equiv 53 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Calculate \( 53 \mod 8 \):
