[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m Check the conditions:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \text{Coins per original bag} = 13
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m Number of original bags:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \[
