[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m All conditions met. Hence, the number of coins before finding the new bag is \( 91 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m We must now determine the smallest suitable answer following all checking results in initial accumulation.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \[
