[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - You redistribute all the coins equally among the eight bags.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 2. **Set Up the Equation:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - After redistribution, each bag should have the same number of coins. Therefore:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \frac{T + 53}{8} \text{ coins per bag}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Since each bag should have an equal number of coins, \( T + 53 \) must be divisible by 8:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      T + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      T + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
