[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 4. **Find the Smallest \( k \) Satisfying the Inequality:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Substitute \( T = 8k - 53 \) into the inequality:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
