[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m The smallest integer \( k \) that satisfies this inequality is \( k = 28 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m ### 4. Calculate \( n \) Using \( k = 28 \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m n = 8(28) + 5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \[
