[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    56k + 60 > 200 \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    56k > 140 \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    k > \frac{140}{56} \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    k > 2.5
