[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 2. Subtract \( 19 \) from both sides to solve for \( x \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
