[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - You redistribute the coins into eight bags so that each bag has the same number of coins, which we will call \( k \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      k = \frac{N + 53}{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - According to the problem, \( k \) must be a whole number, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      N + 53 \text{ is divisible by } 8.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      Therefore:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      N + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      This implies:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      N \equiv -53 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      Calculating:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
