[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      Hence:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      N \equiv 1 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Since \( N = 7n \), we substitute:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m      \[
