[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 1. **Let \( n \) be the number of coins in each of the original seven bags.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 2. **Total number of coins before finding the 53 coins:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - You originally had 7 bags, each containing \( n \) coins:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \text{Total coins} = 7n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 3. **After finding the bag of 53 coins, you add these to the original coins:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Let \( k \) be the total number of coins after redistribution. According to the problem, you redistribute all coins such that all eight bags have the same number of coins.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 4. **Let \( x \) be the number of coins in each of the eight bags after redistribution.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 5. **Since you redistributed all coins equally among the eight bags:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    k = 8x
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 6. **Initially, you have \( k - 53 = 7n \) coins from the original seven bags.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Therefore,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    k - 53 = 7n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    Substituting \( k = 8x \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    8x - 53 = 7n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 7. **We also know that the total number of coins after finding the 53 coins is greater than 200:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    k > 200
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    8x - 53 > 200
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    8x > 253
