[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    x > \frac{253}{8} \approx 31.625
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
