[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    256 - 53 = 7n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    203 = 7n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    n = \frac{203}{7} = 29
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 9. **Calculate the total number of coins before finding the 53 coins:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7n = 7 \times 29 = 203
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m 10. **Verify the solution:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m     
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Original total coins before finding 53 coins:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m     
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    7n = 7 \times 29 = 203
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Finding 53 coins adds to the original:
