[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    - Verify:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    k = 8x = 8 \times 32 = 256
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3356756)[0m    \[
